       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-ADVANCED-THEOREMS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ADVANCED-TF-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SAVEDMODEL-HERMETIC-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TFLITE-FLATBUFFER-ZERO   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRADIENT-CHECKPOINT-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEIGHT-DECAY-DISSIPATE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAGGED-SPARSE-DENSITY    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ADVANCED-TF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-ADVANCED-TF-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ADVANCED-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SERIALIZATION-PROOFS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-OPTIMIZERS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-SPARSE-TENSORS.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-ADVANCED-THEOREMS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SERIALIZATION-PROOFS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SAVEDMODEL-HERMETIC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TFLITE-FLATBUFFER-ZERO.
       2000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-OPTIMIZERS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRADIENT-CHECKPOINT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEIGHT-DECAY-DISSIPATE.
       3000-EVALUATE-SPARSE-TENSORS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAGGED-SPARSE-DENSITY.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-ADVANCED-THEOREMS.
           IF WS-SAVEDMODEL-HERMETIC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TFLITE-FLATBUFFER-ZERO = 1 AND
              WS-GRADIENT-CHECKPOINT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-WEIGHT-DECAY-DISSIPATE = 1 AND
              WS-RAGGED-SPARSE-DENSITY = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-ADVANCED-TF-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ADVANCED-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-ADVANCED-TF-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ADVANCED-CODE.
